# Voice-First Daily Task Tracker (.env.example)
#
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES REQUIRED: NONE
#
# This application is 100% frontend and client-side.
# All natural language parsing, speech recognition, speech synthesis,
# task state management, audio analysis, and data persistence
# operate directly in the user's browser using native Web APIs
# and localStorage.
#
# No external APIs, secrets, or environment variables are required
# for development, preview, or production deployment on Vercel.
